  "title": "Barquillos (Wafer Rolls)",
  "description": "These barquillos, or wafer rolls, are crispy, rolled cookies that are a Filipino delicacy. These treats are easy to make but feel fancy to serve.",
  "authors": [
    "siMPLy_viCky"
  ],
